# Phusion Passenger + Node.js — hostland.ru
PassengerAppType node
PassengerStartupFile server.js
PassengerAppRoot /home/host1688282/practicai.ru/htdocs/www
PassengerNodejs /home/host1688282/practicai.ru/node/v25.2.0/bin/node
PassengerFriendlyErrorPages on
PassengerResolveSymlinksInDocumentRoot on

SetEnv NODE_ENV production

Options -MultiViews
Require all granted
